      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i’m just... disappearing. not like dying, exactly, but more like i’m becoming less of a person every day. it’s like i’m a house and the lights are just going out, room by room, and i can’t stop it. eventually there’s just gonna be nothing left but the dark.",
