    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a lot of work to keep the lights on. like, why fight so hard to sit in a house that's empty? honestly, when I think about just... turning the last light off on my own terms, before the darkness takes over everything, it feels less like a tragedy and more like a relief. like finally being able to rest.",
